@startuml
title Step 2 - Build the Internet Line of Product screen

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "PartyInteractionManagement" as PIM
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM
participant "ProductRecommendationManagement" as PRM
participant "ProductConfigurator" as PC

person -> EM : 10 select a category
activate EM

alt catalog browsing
    note over PCM : Alternatively following API could be used
    EM -> PCM : 11 **TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt** GET /productOffering\n(Category=x&SaleChannel=..)
    activate PCM
    PCM --> EM : 12 **TMF620** 200 OK\nlist of productOffering
    deactivate PCM
else eligible catalog browsing
    EM -> PC : 13 **TMF679 Product Offering Qualification** POST /productOfferingQualification\n(Category=x&commercial criteria)
    activate PC
    PC --> EM : 14 **TMF679** 201 Created\nlist of eligible productOffering
    deactivate PC
else product recommendations (SoI)
    EM -> PRM : 15 **TMF680 RecommendationMgt** POST /queryProductRecommendation\n(Category=x&SaleChannel=..)
    activate PRM
    PRM --> EM : 16 **TMF680** 200 OK\nlist of recommended product
    deactivate PRM
end

note over EM, PCM : Catalog provided information about technical eligibility check requirement

EM -> PCM : 17 TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt GET /productSpecification\n(productSpecificationId=..)
activate PCM
PCM --> EM : 18 **TMF620** 200 OK\nlist of productSpecification
deactivate PCM

EM -> EM : 19 display information
deactivate EM

@enduml
